{"_id":"0b10892641e0dd38","name":"Softened Blow","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 4+","description":"Once per encounter, when an attack against you scores a Critical Hit, you may treat the damage as though it weren't a critical hit. All other effects tied to the crit still apply."}}
{"_id":"112c42e6ba184d81","name":"History Repeats","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 6+","description":"Whenever you use All or Nothing, your partner Digimon's next attack automatically resolves the same way this one did: hit follows hit, miss follows miss, Critical Hit follows Critical Hit, no roll needed. Any modifiers and bonuses that applied to the first attack apply again to this second attack as well."}}
{"_id":"1917311c22469214","name":"Full Deck","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":3,"expCost":750,"requirements":"Courage rank 6+","description":"Whenever you play Card Slash yourself, its bonus applies to both the hit roll and the damage roll, and it now benefits every allied Digimon, not just your own partner. This only triggers off your own use of Card Slash; an allied Tamer playing a card of their own does not trigger this bonus."}}
{"_id":"1e7dec9dac58e73f","name":"Double Dip","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Reliability rank 3+","description":"Once per encounter, when you use a Supply item, you may pay 3 Hope to use a second copy of that same Supply item as part of the same action."}}
{"_id":"3072f3d1e041a4a3","name":"Lighter Load","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 4+","description":"There For You's Hope cost changes from your Sincerity rank to a flat 4 Hope."}}
{"_id":"328d5788a7302b9c","name":"Push Your Luck","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 4+","description":"All or Nothing can be used once per round instead of once per encounter."}}
{"_id":"390959e75d921eec","name":"Card Slash","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Courage rank 3+","description":"Once per round, when you play a card: pay 2 Hope. Your partner Digimon gains +2 to the hit roll of their next attack. This bonus expires at the start of your next turn if it hasn't been used yet."}}
{"_id":"3e4f242575437654","name":"Never Really Gone","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":3,"expCost":900,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 7+","description":"Even while defeated at 0 HP, or after submitting out of a fight against a Dark Digimon, you may still take one action each round, as long as it isn't an attack."}}
{"_id":"446443f35ee4f8a9","name":"Always Ready","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Reliability rank 5+","description":"Double Dip can be used once per round instead of once per encounter."}}
{"_id":"4e41b13430962f54","name":"Quick Draw","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Friendship rank 5+","description":"Wildcard can be used once per round instead of once per encounter."}}
{"_id":"4ed59adf7926f0a9","name":"Guaranteed Opener","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 4+","description":"The first attack your partner Digimon makes each encounter automatically hits, no hit roll required. You may not apply any modifications to this attack in any way, or use this hit with any other abilities."}}
{"_id":"503ff36947000fb1","name":"Know a Guy","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":3,"expCost":750,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 6+","description":"Once between rests, make an Archive skill check. Your total determines what you find: 1 to 10 gets you a Common card, 11 to 20 gets you an Uncommon card, 21 to 29 gets you a Rare card, and 30 or higher gets you a Secret Rare card. The GM chooses the specific card within that rarity, not you."}}
{"_id":"53b91ab2b6ee42d5","name":"Calculated Risk","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 4+","description":"All or Nothing's penalty decreases from -5 to -2."}}
{"_id":"567c0b556e1b077a","name":"There For You","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 3+","description":"Once per round, as a Free Action, when an allied Tamer or Digimon within 4 spaces of you takes damage, you may spend Hope equal to your Sincerity rank to heal them for HP equal to your Sincerity rank."}}
{"_id":"5a9de4d1cdecf170","name":"I Made You","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":3,"expCost":900,"requirements":"Courage rank 7+","description":"Choose one Champion or Ultimate stage Digimon that doesn't require any special condition to digivolve into. Your partner Digimon can now digivolve into that chosen Digimon from any Digimon of the previous stage, even if there's normally no evolutionary link between them at all."}}
{"_id":"6239735bb8ed3cf5","name":"All at Once","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 6+","description":"When There For You triggers, it heals every allied Tamer and Digimon within range, including yourself, for your Sincerity rank, not just the ally who took the damage."}}
{"_id":"63231612a0077f5c","name":"Spare Parts","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":3,"expCost":750,"requirements":"Reliability rank 6+","description":"Once between rests, you may use one Gadget you're carrying but don't have equipped, exactly as though it were equipped, for that one use."}}
{"_id":"63c1ecc77f893aa1","name":"Every Fall Counts","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Love rank 6+","description":"Digimon Queen now triggers whenever any Digimon is defeated in the encounter, not just when your own partner Digimon lands the finishing blow."}}
{"_id":"80206bba3fa822e2","name":"Digimon Queen","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Love rank 3+","description":"Once per round, when your partner Digimon deals enough damage in a single hit to reduce a target to 0 HP, they may immediately make one additional attack, using their Basic Action a second time this round."}}
{"_id":"886891141744d762","name":"All or Nothing","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 3+","description":"Once per encounter, before your partner Digimon makes an attack roll, you may declare All or Nothing. That attack takes a -5 penalty to its hit roll. If it still hits, double the damage dice rolled for that attack (a Critical Hit combines with this doubling for 4x total damage). If it misses, your partner Digimon cannot make any attacks next round."}}
{"_id":"8abee1845b3d17ac","name":"Two for One","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 3+","description":"As your Basic Action, you may pay 3 Hope to play 2 cards at once."}}
{"_id":"8bb4871e1f15d9c3","name":"Bargain","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":2,"expCost":400,"requirements":"Friendship rank 4+","description":"Wildcard's Hope cost drops from 6 to 4."}}
{"_id":"8c7608de6896073d","name":"Well Stocked","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Reliability rank 4+","description":"Double Dip's Hope cost drops to 0."}}
{"_id":"ae2cf9a9486ea72a","name":"Blunt Force","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":2,"expCost":400,"requirements":"Love rank 4+","description":"When your partner Digimon lands a hit, you may choose to forgo any status effect tags on that attack. If you do, deal +2 additional damage instead."}}
{"_id":"aec9b23c0e641051","name":"Close Enough","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Courage rank 4+","description":"Once per encounter, when your partner Digimon's hit roll misses the target number by 3 or less, the attack grazes instead of missing outright. A graze deals half normal damage, bypasses no defenses, and triggers no additional effects from the move's tags."}}
{"_id":"aeff4bab379cd2ad","name":"Sharper Eye","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Love rank 6+","description":"Your partner Digimon's attacks now score a Critical Hit on a roll of 18, 19, or 20, not just a natural 20."}}
{"_id":"b0550dfc8179723e","name":"Waste Not","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Reliability rank 6+","description":"When you use Double Dip, you no longer need to consume a second copy of the item. The second use is free."}}
{"_id":"b7bb707cd32da274","name":"Higher Draw","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Courage rank 4+","description":"Card Slash's bonus changes from a flat +2 to 1d8 instead. Roll it fresh every time you play a card."}}
{"_id":"c37ca4452adf5073","name":"Wildcard","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":1,"expCost":300,"requirements":"Friendship rank 3+","description":"Once per encounter, as your Basic Action, pay 6 Hope to play any Common card, even if you don't actually have that card."}}
{"_id":"c46031c9daea8b4f","name":"Bulk Discount","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 5+","description":"Two for One's Hope cost drops to 0."}}
{"_id":"c7d7037f4cadb3c7","name":"Rationing","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kenta.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kenta","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Reliability rank 4+","description":"When eating Food, you and your partner Digimon may share one portion between you. Both of you avoid hunger, but neither of you gains that Food's bonus effect."}}
{"_id":"d11f5be6714d2a9a","name":"Piggyback","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 6+","description":"Whenever an allied Tamer plays a card as their Basic Action, you may spend your own action on their turn to play a card using Two for One. If you do, both cards' effects apply to both your partner Digimon and their partner Digimon. The allied Tamer plays one card, and you play one card; Two for One does not allow you to play two cards yourself, it combines your card with the allied Tamer's card."}}
{"_id":"d7744867ff4483e2","name":"Wider Circle","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Jeri.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Jeri","row":2,"expCost":400,"requirements":"Sincerity rank 4+","description":"There For You's range increases from 4 spaces to 8 spaces."}}
{"_id":"dfdb862a6a0d62c7","name":"Undisputed","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Love rank 5+","description":"Whenever your partner Digimon defeats an enemy, they gain +2 to all hit and damage rolls for the remainder of the encounter. This stacks each time they defeat another enemy in the same encounter."}}
{"_id":"e10e098f8d08d1ab","name":"Free Draw","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Takato.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Takato","row":2,"expCost":400,"requirements":"Courage rank 4+","description":"Card Slash now costs 0 Hope to play."}}
{"_id":"e440e3058dc11d01","name":"Not Today","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Ryo.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Ryo","row":3,"expCost":900,"requirements":"Highest Crest Stat rank 7+","description":"Once between rests, when your partner Digimon reaches 0 HP, you may keep them in the fight instead, restoring their HP by up to 2x their highest Crest Stat rank. They do not dedigivolve, and no other effects from reaching 0 HP trigger, other than this one. If the hit that reduced your partner Digimon to 0 HP would have taken them into negative HP, this ability still restores HP as though they'd stopped exactly at 0; the overflow damage doesn't eat into how much you restore."}}
{"_id":"ef726516912d2189","name":"Full House","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 5+","description":"Two for One's cards can now be played as a Free Action instead of your Basic Action."}}
{"_id":"f3b4c0b538ad95a5","name":"Momentai","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":2,"expCost":400,"requirements":"Friendship rank 4+","description":"When you would take damage, you may pay 3 Hope to activate Momentai. Until the end of the round, whenever you would take damage, reduce that damage to 0 and add the prevented damage to a Damage Pool. At the end of the round, apply all damage in the Damage Pool to you at once."}}
{"_id":"f3b86e233b9641f2","name":"Know Your Enemy","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Kazu.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Kazu","row":2,"expCost":450,"requirements":"Knowledge rank 4+","description":"At the start of each encounter, before turns begin, name one tag from the Move Tags list in Chapter 11. Until the end of the round, your partner Digimon takes -2 damage from attacks using that tag."}}
{"_id":"f5c6a94fc737e43f","name":"Blue Card","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":3,"expCost":800,"requirements":"Friendship rank 7+","description":"Once per encounter, as your Basic Action, pay 3 Hope and roll 1d10. On a 9 or 10, you may play a Secret Rare card, even if you don't have one. On a 5 to 8, you may play a Rare card, even if you don't have one."}}
{"_id":"f7a12f88ec5d09bb","name":"Relentless","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Rika.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Rika","row":2,"expCost":500,"requirements":"Love rank 5+","description":"Digimon Queen loses its once per round restriction. Your partner Digimon can trigger it every time they defeat a target with a single hit, no matter how many times that happens in a round."}}
{"_id":"f94f81560e8054e9","name":"Wider Net","type":"classSkill","img":"systems/digital-destiny/assets/DigiDestined/Henry.webp","effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"class":"Henry","row":3,"expCost":750,"requirements":"Friendship rank 6+","description":"Wildcard now works on Uncommon cards as well as Common."}}
